	)
	(text "2026-11-18: 3-wire protected pack with one internal NTC. The second pack NTC (PACK_GUARD) has no sensor: U8, R43, R44, R45 are DNP and the window comparator is out of the charge-permission chain (U9 and JP1 remain). To revive it, re-value R43/R44/R45 for the BQ24074 TS node (75 µA bias) and fit without a 10 k pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
